error[B0410]: `count` is read after it is written in this closure
 --> check/state.bloom:9:17
  |
9 |     let shown = count
  |                 ^^^^^ this reads the value the view drew with, not the new one
  |
help: bind the new value first: `let next = …; count = next`, then use `next`
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#73-reactivity-compile-time

error[B0420]: the hook `useTranslation` is called outside a view member
  --> check/state.bloom:18:15
   |
18 |   let { t } = useTranslation()
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a hook runs on every render, in the same order
   |
help: call it as a view member (`let value = useTranslation(…)`), or at the top level of a hook function (`fn useX`)
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#73-reactivity-compile-time

error[B0401]: `open` is written while the view draws
  --> check/state.bloom:25:5
   |
25 |     open = true
   |     ^^^^ a state changes in an event, not in the body or a derived value
   |
help: write it in a handler (`fn`, `.onPress { … }`) or a `.task { … }`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#73-reactivity-compile-time

warning[B0950]: `view`/`screen`/`layout` declarations is Bloom 0.x (2 times in this file)
 --> check/state.bloom:3:1
  |
3 | view Counter {
  | ^^^^ retired in 2.0
  |
help: write `struct X: View { … var body: some View { … } }`, or run `bloomc migrate --from 0.x` on the file
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#141-bloomc-migrate---from-0x-20

warning[B0950]: `fn` is Bloom 0.x (2 times in this file)
 --> check/state.bloom:7:3
  |
7 |   fn bump() {
  |   ^^ retired in 2.0
  |
help: write `func` (its parameters are labelled; `_` for none), or run `bloomc migrate --from 0.x` on the file
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#141-bloomc-migrate---from-0x-20

warning[B0950]: `${…}` interpolation is Bloom 0.x (once in this file)
  --> check/state.bloom:13:18
   |
13 |     Button(Text("${doubled}")).onPress { bump() }
   |                  ^^ retired in 2.0
   |
help: write `\(…)`, or run `bloomc migrate --from 0.x` on the file
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#141-bloomc-migrate---from-0x-20
